{"src":"tr","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":192300,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"tr","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8912.212246,"text":"Ulusal hazine filmini izlediyseniz bağımsızlık bildirgesinin arkasında bir hazine haritası çizilmiş olduğunu düşünebilirsiniz."},{"kind":"text","t":9919.62779,"text":"If you have seen the National Treasure movie, you might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the declaration of independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":10035.429406,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10040.237454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":10045.417786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":10050.779543999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10056.205492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10061.487812,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":10062.691241,"samples":12792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":16144.811136999999,"text":"Sıcak çikolata Belçika standartlarındadır. Meyve suları pahalı fakat muhteşemdir."},{"kind":"text","t":16574.089458000002,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are expensive but wonderful."},{"kind":"audio","t":16682.990171999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":16687.959677,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16690.587802000002,"samples":21464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"audio","t":16766.315301000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16771.678379999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16773.921531,"samples":16664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":23719.344359000002,"text":"Fakat bu doğru değil. Belgenin arka yüzünde yazılı bir şey bulunmasına rağmen bu bir hazine haritası değildir."},{"kind":"text","t":24491.468524999997,"text":"But this is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"audio","t":24595.793425999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24597.463898,"samples":18232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"audio","t":24683.814965999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24689.145494999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24694.268847,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24699.925260999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":24700.294354999998,"samples":5128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":33726.931259,"text":"Kendi hükümetiniz dışındaki hükümetlerin tavsiyelerine de danışabilirsiniz. Ancak onların tavsiyeleri kendi vatandaşlarına yöneliktir."},{"kind":"text","t":34311.07847,"text":"You may also consult the advice of governments other than your own. However, their recommendations are directed toward their own citizens."},{"kind":"audio","t":34414.678314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34417.751502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34419.880294999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34420.18298,"samples":15696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":34494.449654,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34496.134255,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34497.654948999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34498.277269,"samples":21096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":45114.159738999995,"text":"Hong Kong adası Hong Kong bölgesine adını verir ve pek çok ziyaretçinin asıl odak noktası olarak değerlendirdiği yerdir."},{"kind":"text","t":46139.839262,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives its name to the Hong Kong region and is the place that many visitors consider to be the main focal point."},{"kind":"audio","t":46260.460784999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46265.732424999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46270.930217,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":46276.03135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":46281.416917999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46286.663429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46289.627018,"samples":23592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":59879.077281,"text":"Yüksek enlemlerde veya dağ geçitlerinde araç kullanacak olan herhangi bir kimse kar, buz veya donma ihtimalini göz önünde bulundurmalıdır."},{"kind":"text","t":60908.57728,"text":"Anyone who will be driving at high latitudes or through mountain passes should take into account the possibility of snow, ice, or frost."},{"kind":"audio","t":61029.593496,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61034.693069,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61039.91397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61044.996104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61050.273354,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61055.673191999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61059.905119999996,"samples":28992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":66960.933063,"text":"Her nesilde iki havuz arasındaki ayrım ve yeniden birleşim varyasyonu ileri geri karıştırır."},{"kind":"text","t":67741.478585,"text":"In every generation, the variation of separation and recombination between the two pools mixes back and forth."},{"kind":"audio","t":67862.003421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67866.99031600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67872.40999300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67877.750142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67882.872745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67888.473469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":67888.67673600001,"samples":4992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":76806.64291400001,"text":"Böcek terimi böcek bilinciler tarafından bu böcek türü için resmi şekilde kullanılır."},{"kind":"text","t":77511.60098500001,"text":"The term \"insect\" is used formally by entomologists for this species of insect."},{"kind":"audio","t":77623.58067600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77628.5754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77634.125476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77639.59070300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":77641.402592,"samples":16528,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":87765.86558000001,"text":"Her şeyden önce binicilerin büyük kısmı topuklu ve pürüzsüz gayet dar tabağını binici çizmesi giyer."},{"kind":"text","t":88605.81684900001,"text":"First and foremost, the majority of riders wear quite narrow, heeled, and smooth tan riding boots."},{"kind":"audio","t":88721.385549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88726.24572600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88731.523866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":88736.80474600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88741.87916000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":88742.19630400001,"samples":2360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":97282.679197,"text":"Martelli, Ekim ayında başlayan ve katılımın yüksek olduğu rejim karşıtı gösterilere bu komisyonla yanıt verdi."},{"kind":"text","t":98244.909222,"text":"Martelli responded to the anti-regime protests, which began in October and saw high participation, with this commission."},{"kind":"audio","t":98365.490237,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98370.749387,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98375.729982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98381.017042,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98386.253822,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98391.49098300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":98393.345902,"samples":16392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":102781.850122,"text":"İtfaiye ekipleri sonunda yangını gece 11.35'te söndürdü."},{"kind":"text","t":103478.97348700001,"text":"Firefighters finally extinguished the fire at 11:35 p.m."},{"kind":"audio","t":103585.24467500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103590.494475,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103595.622828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103600.79132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":103601.170243,"samples":1528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":109640.97017100001,"text":"Atlantik Kasırga mevsiminin isim verilen 10. fırtınası olan"},{"kind":"text","t":110165.845642,"text":"the 10th named storm of the Atlantic hurricane season"},{"kind":"audio","t":110274.783995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110279.916857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110284.07058700001,"samples":29264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":115647.894199,"text":"Jeri Alt tropik fırtınası bugün Atlantik okyanusunda ortaya çıktı."},{"kind":"text","t":116152.408397,"text":"Subtropical Storm Jeri formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"audio","t":116250.43512600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116255.727186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116261.095424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116263.07037100001,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":125441.91231100001,"text":"Bize treni, arabayı ve daha birçok ulaşım aracını getirdi."},{"kind":"text","t":126099.956072,"text":"It brought us the train, the car, and many other means of transportation."},{"kind":"audio","t":126205.98846400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126210.9007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":126216.231749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126221.261583,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":126221.46726,"samples":928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":140525.22962499998,"text":"M.S. 400 dolaylarında lüksün merkezi olarak ün kazandı ve bu şöhreti yaklaşık M.S. 1100 yılına kadar sürdürdü."},{"kind":"text","t":141609.362252,"text":"Around 400 AD, it gained fame as a center of luxury and maintained this reputation until approximately 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":141733.985587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141739.200238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141744.56165699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141749.69889899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141754.99346899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141760.18889999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141765.43062099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141766.85588699998,"samples":18424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":148302.41952199998,"text":"Ayın yüzeyi kayalardan ve tozdan oluşur. Ayın dış katmanına kabuk ismi verilir."},{"kind":"text","t":148808.575502,"text":"The surface of the moon consists of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"audio","t":148913.09743999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148918.141584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148921.691994,"samples":25664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"audio","t":148988.092942,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148993.271243,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148995.427047,"samples":18464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":156551.988995,"text":"ABD Mühendisler Birliği 6 inçlik yağışın daha önce sararı gören setleri aşabileceğine ihtimal vermiştir."},{"kind":"text","t":157582.03596399998,"text":"The American Society of Civil Engineers has suggested that 6 inches of rainfall could overflow the levees that have previously seen yellowing."},{"kind":"audio","t":157708.026636,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157713.515242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157718.60008499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157724.027843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157729.495859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157734.952456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157738.897329,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157740.288935,"samples":19024,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":165172.898927,"text":"Özellikle mikro ifadeleri doğru bir şekilde yorumlama yöntemiyle bir kişinin yalan söyleyip söylemediğinin anlaşılabileceği öne sürülüyor."},{"kind":"text","t":166198.382353,"text":"It is suggested that whether a person is lying or not can be understood, particularly through the method of correctly interpreting micro-expressions."},{"kind":"audio","t":166324.191919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166329.136054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166334.328156,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":166339.75882299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":166345.04622299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166350.370112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166355.408566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166357.160296,"samples":23824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":171687.44006999998,"text":"Yapıları kazıyarak ya da duvar yazısı yazarak onlara saygısızlık etmeyin."},{"kind":"text","t":172291.33585499998,"text":"Do not disrespect the structures by scratching them or writing graffiti on them."},{"kind":"audio","t":172393.66248,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":172398.907521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172404.03548299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172409.37323199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":172409.565939,"samples":2728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":182417.622462,"text":"Kaplanın kükremesi bir aslanın tam sesli kükremesi gibi değil, çok daha hırıltılı, bağıran sözlerle kurulan bir cümleyi andırıyor."},{"kind":"text","t":183716.62654499998,"text":"A tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion; it resembles a sentence constructed with much raspier, shouting words."},{"kind":"audio","t":183875.81482099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":183885.054873,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":183890.559559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":183890.866374,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":184008.024197,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184009.819216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184011.731784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184012.43130199998,"samples":22296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":190525.051328,"text":"20. yüzyılda gerçekleştirilen araştırmalar iki farklı genetik varyasyon havuzu olduğunu göstermiştir."},{"kind":"text","t":191340.12811199998,"text":"Research conducted in the 20th century has shown that there are two different genetic variation pools."},{"kind":"audio","t":191452.326979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":191457.403762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":191462.66999199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":191467.99088199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":191473.248512,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":191474.80966499998,"samples":14960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":191954.641825,"text":"Gizli ve dışa vurulu."},{"kind":"text","t":192199.460141,"text":"Hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"audio","t":192291.255556,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192291.817536,"samples":15832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"close","t":202303.52144699998,"code":1005}]}